Design a 4-to-1 multiplexer using NAND gates. The module takes a 4-bit input vector A and a 2-bit select input S. It processes the inputs through two stages of NAND operations, where each stage reduces the signal space based on the select lines. The final output combines the results of stage two, producing a single output that reflects the selected input line based on the value of S.
