description:
Design a 4-bit asynchronous up counter that increments its value on each positive edge of the clock signal (CLK). When the active-low reset signal (nRst) is low, the counter resets to zero. Otherwise, the counter maintains its current value and increments it by one at each clock pulse, thereby allowing for counting in a binary fashion from 0 to 15.
module top_module(
    CLK,
    nRst,
    value
);

code:
module top_module(
    CLK,
    nRst,
    value
);input CLK, nRst;
output reg [3:0] value;

always @(posedge CLK) begin
    if(nRst == 1'b0) begin
        value <= #1 4'h0;
    end
    else begin
        value <= #1 value + 1;
    end
end

endmodule

